{"title":"Revenge of the Bloom Flower","synopsis":"Satu kitab legendaris pemicu badai darah. Satu malam yang merenggut segalanya. Demi membalas kematian orang-orang tercintanya akibat perebutan kitab “Wisdom of the Secret Master”, Woonseon mengubur masa lalunya yang suci. Di dunia Jianghu yang kejam—di mana harta, takhta, dan cinta bersifat fana layaknya bunga yang layu dalam sepuluh hari—kini hanya dendamnya yang menolak untuk mati.","alternative_title":"화무십일홍","author":"Bluebeard, Dongryeon","artist":"404nf","genres":["Action","Drama","Martial Arts","Shounen"],"chapters":[{"id":"92350cd0-557f-4651-91f4-b99d9c0684a3","number":"66","title":"Chapter 66","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"id":"3897a95f-96df-49a3-85ca-d567d7490e47","number":"65","title":"Chapter 65","date":"2026-08-03","images":[]},{"id":"f4a84a70-7b72-415e-ac00-c5a3454252f1","number":"64","title":"Chapter 64","date":"2026-08-01","images":[]},{"id":"6df9319f-f08b-491a-946a-cbed7ed15873","number":"63","title":"Chapter 63","date":"2026-07-31","images":[]},{"id":"420d863b-79ad-4166-8b9c-86894a2081ca","number":"62","title":"Chapter 62","date":"2026-07-30","images":[]},{"id":"c0de9398-8c73-448f-bcb7-9e046e616837","number":"61","title":"Chapter 61","date":"2026-07-19","images":[]},{"id":"6c2fba57-3271-4be5-9ed6-fbe132b92209","number":"60","title":"Chapter 60","date":"2026-07-19","images":[]},{"id":"50fa57f2-5dba-4722-b8ee-63643a36cd20","number":"59","title":"Chapter 59","date":"2026-07-19","images":[]},{"id":"e273aab5-0a1f-4970-b993-31fd92e36629","number":"58","title":"Chapter 58","date":"2026-07-19","images":[]},{"id":"33e87113-8a73-4e58-a474-2a8d1d69222b","number":"57","title":"Chapter 57","date":"2026-07-19","images":[]},{"id":"627a86f5-4db3-44ca-bd0c-522cbf944429","number":"56","title":"Chapter 56","date":"2026-07-19","images":[]},{"id":"4829757b-aa1e-41c7-be58-e93b7e60d5a1","number":"55","title":"Chapter 55","date":"2026-07-19","images":[]},{"id":"c0566f42-8887-4334-9527-e94f56215294","number":"54","tit